{"id":"n62275-1-6","stage":1,"title":"나중 · 后来","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62275-1-6-1","ko":"선배, 어서 병원에 가요. 병 키워서 나중에 후회하지 말고요.","zh":"前辈，快去医院吧。别把病拖下去，以后可别后悔啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선배,","meaning":"前辈","explanation":"선배：前辈。","readings":[{"term":"선배","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66306","senseId":"1","lemma":"선배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선배","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3"}},{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快。","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"가요.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}},{"text":"병","meaning":"病","explanation":"병：病。","readings":[{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62694","senseId":"1","lemma":"병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}},{"text":"키워서","meaning":"使加重（병을 키우다：把病拖重）","explanation":"키우다：使加重（병을 키우다：把病拖重）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"1","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키워서","audio":"/audio/623ecd56bacc2d151ecc.mp3"}},{"text":"나중에","meaning":"后来，以后","explanation":"나중：后来，以后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나중","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62275","senseId":"1","lemma":"나중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나중에","audio":"/audio/a12252500035668f76c9.mp3"}},{"text":"후회하지","meaning":"后悔，悔恨，悔悟","explanation":"후회하다：后悔，悔恨，悔悟；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"후회하다","audio":"/audio/33f63598b0e30da3df08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62367","senseId":"1","lemma":"후회하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후회하지","audio":"/audio/9cf5504d98dbaaf0e8aa.mp3"}},{"text":"말고요.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：省略后续内容而结束句子，常用于回答或委婉的指示；加 요 更礼貌；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고요","audio":"/audio/1522547117ca098855fd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5a64f841df328061","term":"선배","zh":"前辈","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3","entryId":"66306","definition":"在相同领域里比自己先开始活动而经验或地位等更领先的人。","pronunciation":["선배"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"31eaf1068c99d7f1","term":"병","zh":"病","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3","entryId":"62694","definition":"生物体的身体发生异常，导致生物体无法进行正常活动并感到难受的现象。","pronunciation":["병ː"]},{"id":"cff5458b4f7fee67","term":"키우다","zh":"使加重（병을 키우다：把病拖重）","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3","entryId":"66587","definition":"使加重（병을 키우다：把病拖重）","pronunciation":["키우다"]},{"id":"b8922cba892bea4a","term":"나중","zh":"后来，以后","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3","entryId":"62275","definition":"一定的时间过后。","pronunciation":["나ː중"]},{"id":"33f63598b0e30da3","term":"후회하다","zh":"后悔，悔恨，悔悟","audio":"/audio/33f63598b0e30da3df08.mp3","entryId":"62367","definition":"认识到以前做的事情的错误，责怪自己。","pronunciation":["후ː회하다","후ː훼하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fdbe8b32e3d4a85a0962.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62275-1-6-2","ko":"알았어. 곧 갈게.","zh":"知道了，我马上就过去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}},{"text":"곧","meaning":"马上，就","explanation":"곧：马上，就。","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"1","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}},{"text":"갈게.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈게","audio":"/audio/efb52f5ce543c0d52bdf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"马上，就","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"不拖延，紧接着。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc0d304c8b2e2409f693.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.722,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62275","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1727,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["前辈，别去医院，等病更严重再说。","前辈，快去医院吧。别把病拖下去，以后可别后悔啊。","前辈，病已经好了，不用再检查了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["知道了，明年再去。","我不去，也不准备听你的建议。","知道了，我马上就过去。"],"answer":2}]}
